2	// Both the IMAP/SMTP backend (lib/mail/*, lib/actions-mail.ts) and the UI
3	// (components/customer/mail/*, app/dashboard/mail) build against these types so
4	// they can't drift. The client connects to the customer's own mailbox on the
5	// self-hosted mail server (10.20.0.10) over IMAP (993) / SMTP submission (587),
6	// authenticating with the mailbox's stored (encrypted) credential.
